# Environment Variable Reference

Complete list of every environment variable used across the Zela backend.
Grouped by concern. Required vars are marked **[required]**.

---

## Core Server

| Variable | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `PORT` | | `3000` | HTTP port the Express server binds to |
| `NODE_ENV` | | `development` | `production` enables live Reloadly endpoints, SSL for Postgres, and locks GEO_BYPASS |
| `CORS_ORIGINS` | | `*` (all) | Comma-separated allowed origins e.g. `https://app.zela.com,https://zela.com` |

---

## Firebase Authentication

| Variable | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID` | **[required]** | — | Firebase project ID for token verification |
| `FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON` | | — | Full service account JSON as a string (for platforms without file mounts like Railway). If absent, falls back to ADC |

---

## Databases

| Variable | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `DATABASE_URL` | **[required]** | — | Postgres connection string e.g. `postgres://user:pass@host:5432/zela` |
| `MONGODB_URI` | **[required]** | — | MongoDB connection string e.g. `mongodb+srv://user:pass@cluster.mongodb.net/zela` |
| `MONGODB_DB_NAME` | | `zela` | MongoDB database name |

---

## Solana / Fee Payer

| Variable | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `FEE_PAYER_SECRET_KEY` | **[required]** | — | Base58-encoded fee payer keypair secret key |
| `ALCHEMY_RPC_URL` | **[required]** | — | Solana RPC endpoint e.g. `https://solana-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY` |
| `SOLANA_COMMITMENT` | | `confirmed` | RPC commitment level: `confirmed` or `finalized` (finalized = safer, ~8s slower) |
| `MAX_TX_AGE_SECONDS` | | `600` | Reject Solana transactions older than this many seconds (replay protection) |
| `AMOUNT_TOLERANCE_BPS` | | `50` | Basis points tolerance on received USDC/USDT amount (50 = 0.5%) |
| `FEE_PAYER_MIN_USDC_WARN` | | `10` | `/health/deep` warns and returns 503 if USDC balance falls below this |
| `FEE_PAYER_MIN_USDT_WARN` | | `10` | `/health/deep` warns and returns 503 if USDT balance falls below this |

---

## Reloadly

| Variable | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `RELOADLY_CLIENT_ID` | **[required]** | — | OAuth2 client ID from Reloadly dashboard → Developers → API Settings |
| `RELOADLY_CLIENT_SECRET` | **[required]** | — | OAuth2 client secret from same location |

---

## Gift Cards

| Variable | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GIFTCARD_ENCRYPTION_KEY` | **[required]** | — | 64-char hex string (32 bytes) for AES-256-GCM redeem code encryption. Generate: `node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"` |
| `GIFTCARD_MAX_CODE_ATTEMPTS` | | `5` | Max retry attempts for fetching a redeem code before giving up |

---

## Geo Restriction

| Variable | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GEO_MODE` | | `denylist` | `denylist` blocks listed countries; `allowlist` blocks all except listed |
| `GEO_BLOCKED_COUNTRIES` | | _(empty)_ | Comma-separated ISO-2 codes to block in denylist mode e.g. `VE,AF` |
| `GEO_ALLOWED_COUNTRIES` | | _(empty)_ | Comma-separated ISO-2 codes to allow in allowlist mode e.g. `NG,GH,KE` |
| `GEO_BLOCK_UNKNOWN_IP` | | `true` | Block requests from IPs that cannot be geolocated |
| `GEO_BYPASS` | | `false` | **Dev only.** Skips all geo checks. Causes process to exit if set in production |
| `GEO_AIRTIME_MODE` | | _(none)_ | Per-service geo mode for airtime: `allowlist` or `denylist` |
| `GEO_AIRTIME_COUNTRIES` | | _(none)_ | Per-service country list for airtime |
| `GEO_DATA_MODE` | | _(none)_ | Per-service geo mode for data |
| `GEO_DATA_COUNTRIES` | | _(none)_ | Per-service country list for data |
| `GEO_UTILITIES_MODE` | | _(none)_ | Per-service geo mode for utilities |
| `GEO_UTILITIES_COUNTRIES` | | _(none)_ | Per-service country list for utilities |
| `GEO_GIFTCARDS_MODE` | | _(none)_ | Per-service geo mode for gift cards |
| `GEO_GIFTCARDS_COUNTRIES` | | _(none)_ | Per-service country list for gift cards |

---

## Background Jobs

| Variable | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `JOB_UTILITY_POLL_CRON` | | `*/2 * * * *` | Cron for utility order status poller (every 2 min) |
| `JOB_GIFTCARD_RETRY_CRON` | | `*/5 * * * *` | Cron for gift card code retry job (every 5 min) |
| `JOB_CLEANUP_CRON` | | `0 * * * *` | Cron for stale order cleanup (every hour) |
| `JOB_CACHE_REFRESH_CRON` | | `0 3 * * *` | Cron for operator/biller cache refresh (daily 3am UTC) |
| `UTILITY_MAX_POLL_ATTEMPTS` | | `20` | Give up polling a utility order after this many attempts |
| `MAX_PENDING_AGE_HOURS` | | `1` | Expire PENDING orders with no payment after this many hours |
| `MAX_CONFIRMED_AGE_HOURS` | | `1` | Expire CRYPTO_CONFIRMED orders never dispatched after this many hours |
| `CACHE_REFRESH_COUNTRIES` | | `NG,GH,KE,ZA,UG,TZ,US,GB,IN,BR` | Comma-separated countries to pre-warm in cache refresh job |

---

## Admin

| Variable | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ADMIN_UIDS` | | _(empty — admin locked)_ | Comma-separated Firebase UIDs allowed to access `/v1/admin/*` |

---

## Minimal production `.env`

```bash
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=3000

# Firebase
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON={"type":"service_account",...}

# Databases
DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@host:5432/zela
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://user:pass@cluster.mongodb.net/zela

# Solana
FEE_PAYER_SECRET_KEY=your_base58_secret_key
ALCHEMY_RPC_URL=https://solana-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/your_key
SOLANA_COMMITMENT=finalized

# Reloadly
RELOADLY_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
RELOADLY_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret

# Gift cards
GIFTCARD_ENCRYPTION_KEY=64_char_hex_here

# Geo (example: Africa + UK + US only, all services)
GEO_MODE=allowlist
GEO_ALLOWED_COUNTRIES=NG,GH,KE,ZA,UG,TZ,RW,SN,CI,US,GB,CA

# Admin
ADMIN_UIDS=firebase_uid_1,firebase_uid_2

# Alerts
FEE_PAYER_MIN_USDC_WARN=50
FEE_PAYER_MIN_USDT_WARN=50
```